26 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/AP<</N 261 0 R>>/BS<</Type/Border/S/S/W 1>>/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 0 Tf)/F 2/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK<<>>/P 8 0 R/Q 0/Rect[601.2719 171.74756 724.6225 440.40394]/T(CustomerSegments)/V(PRIMARY \(paying\):\r\200 Stuck Founders/Solopreneurs: High opportunity cost; stuck on strategic pivots or priority conflicts.\r\r\200  Creative Professionals: Writers/Producers at identity crossroads \("Should I keep doing this?"\).\r\r\200  Independent consultants at transitions. Help others find clarity. Struggle to find their own.\r\rKey Insight: These users are not "sick"; they are "stuck." They view their mental friction as a business cost.\r\r\rEARLY ADOPTERS \(Highest Signal\):\r\200  The "Waitlist" cohort. My 800+ existing course buyers who already trust my methodology.\r\200 Build-in-public enthusiasts. English-speaking founders on LinkedIn/X who prioritize self-optimization.\r\200 AI Refugees: People who tried LLMs for deep thinking and found them counter-productive.\r)>>
endobj

27 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/AP<</N 262 0 R>>/BS<</Type/Border/S/S/W 1>>/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 0 Tf)/F 2/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK<<>>/P 8 0 R/Q 0/Rect[81.95759 171.74756 205.30821 440.40394]/T(Problem)/V(Data shows 1 in 4 adults suffer from severe cognitive overload. For founders and creative professionals, this manifests as strategic decision paralysis. They loop on timing, priorities, and identity shifts despite having enough information. The block is internal friction, not ignorance.\r\r\rEXISTING ALTERNATIVES\r\200 Premature AI Advice: ChatGPT/Claude generate lists that increase cognitive load. Research confirms advice makes overthinking worse for those already stuck..\r\200 The Cold-Start Problem: Digital tools have zero memory of a user's emotional or strategic state; users must re-explain context every session..\r\200 Human coaching is effective but scales poorly, costing \240200 or more per session with long waitlists.\r\200 Meditation apps are gamified, passive, and become another daily obligation.\r\r\r\rMarket Gap: No product owns the "structured reflection before execution" space.)>>
endobj

